title: The Mandate Commission
subtitle: Who has the right to vote here?
view-if: congress = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and congress_used_mandates = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.congress_used_mandates = 1;
RG.congress.target();
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Mandate Commission

Before any vote, the mandate commission reports on the delegates' credentials. [? if congress_mandates_code = 1 : Each district sends delegates in proportion to its members, so the big districts carry the congress. ?][? if congress_mandates_code = 2 : The small districts have as much weight as the big ones. ?][? if congress_mandates_code = 3 : The members of the Zentrale sit with full votes. ?] The commission is chaired by one of ours. It can be persuaded to find irregularities.

The [+ congress_target_name +] delegation, the strongest against us, was elected at meetings nobody from the Zentrale attended.

- @members: Count every delegation by its membership.
- @districts: Give the small districts an equal voice.
- @zentrale: Seat the members of the Zentrale with a vote.
- @challenge: Challenge the mandates from [+ congress_target_name +].

@members
subtitle: The big districts gain weight. Fair, and everyone knows it.
view-if: congress_mandates_code != 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.setMandates('members');
RG.congress.bitter(1);
!}

The commission recounts: one delegate for so many paid-up members, everywhere. Our side now has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.

@districts
subtitle: The small districts gain weight. The big ones protest.
view-if: congress_mandates_code != 2
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.setMandates('districts');
RG.congress.bitter(2);
!}

The commission rules that a district is a district, large or small. The big delegations walk out for an hour and come back. Our side now has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.

@zentrale
subtitle: Helps whoever holds the Zentrale. The congress will call it a fix.
view-if: congress_mandates_code != 3
on-arrival: {!
RG.congress.setMandates('zentrale');
RG.congress.bitter(3);
Q.unity -= 3;
!}

The members of the Zentrale take their seats among the delegates, with votes. It is in the statutes, the commission says, more or less. Our side now has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.

@challenge
subtitle: Most of their delegates lose their votes. Their current will be furious.
on-arrival: {!
var n = RG.congress.annul(Q.congress_target, Q.congress_target_faction, 0.6);
Q.congress_last_moved = n;
RG.congress.bitter(5);
if (Q.congress_target_faction && Q[Q.congress_target_faction + '_satisfaction'] !== undefined) {
    Q[Q.congress_target_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
Q.unity -= 4;
RG.district(Q.congress_target, {loyalty: -10});
!}

The commission finds that the [+ congress_target_name +] meetings were not properly called. [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates of the [+ congress_target_faction_name +] lose their votes and watch from the gallery. Our side now has [+ congress_votes_for +]% of the hall.
